---
import PolicyLayout from '../layouts/PolicyLayout.astro';
---

<PolicyLayout
  title="Shipping & Delivery"
  description="Nationwide delivery coverage across Qatar, delivery timeframes, courier standards, and transparent fee structure for LUMÈRA LUXE."
  intro="We deliver across Qatar, including Doha, Lusail, and The Pearl."
  links={[
    { id: 'delivery-areas', label: 'Delivery areas' },
    { id: 'delivery-times', label: 'Delivery times' },
    { id: 'delivery-fees', label: 'Delivery fees' },
    { id: 'package-checks', label: 'Package checks' }
  ]}
  contact={{
    title: "Questions about delivery?",
    text: "Message our team if you have a delivery question or need an urgent delivery in Doha.",
    message: "Hello LUMÈRA LUXE, I have a delivery inquiry for an address in Qatar."
  }}
>
  <section id="delivery-areas">
    <h2>Where we deliver</h2>
    <p>
      LUMÈRA LUXE coordinates courier dispatch to all residential, diplomatic, and commercial addresses in the State of Qatar, including:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Zone 1: Central Doha:</strong> West Bay, Al Dafna, Musheireb, Al Sadd, Old Airport, Al Hilal, Al Mansoura.</li>
      <li><strong>Zone 2: Modern Waterfronts:</strong> The Pearl-Qatar, Lusail Marina, Fox Hills, Legtaifiya, Katara Cultural Village.</li>
      <li><strong>Zone 3: Greater Municipalities:</strong> Al Rayyan, Al Gharrafa, Education City, Al Waab, Abu Hamour, Ain Khaled.</li>
      <li><strong>Zone 4: Southern & Northern Regions:</strong> Al Wakrah, Al Wukair, Mesaieed, Umm Salal, Al Khor, and surrounding areas.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="delivery-times">
    <h2>Delivery times</h2>
    <p>
      Orders confirmed with our WhatsApp Concierge are dispatched swiftly for <strong>doorstep delivery within 6 hours</strong> anywhere across Doha and greater Qatar.
    </p>
    <p>
      Prior to dispatch, our courier driver will contact you via WhatsApp or phone call to verify that you or your representative are available at your specified Qatar address. We do not leave fragrance parcels unattended on doorsteps or gates due to delicate temperature sensitivity and value protection.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="delivery-fees">
    <h2>Delivery fees</h2>
    <p>
      Delivery rates are completely transparent with zero hidden fees:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Free Delivery Above 300 QAR:</strong> All purchases <strong>above 300 QAR</strong> qualify for complimentary express delivery anywhere in Qatar.</li>
      <li><strong>Orders of 300 QAR or Less:</strong> A flat courier fee of <strong>25 QAR</strong> applies for orders of 300 QAR or less, quoted clearly before order confirmation.</li>
      <li><strong>Zero Hidden Fees:</strong> No packaging surcharges, card payment fees, or unexpected markups upon arrival.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="package-checks">
    <h2>Storage and package checks</h2>
    <p>
      We pack orders by hand. Qatar's warm climate requires meticulous fragrance preservation. All inventory is stored in climate-controlled boutique premises at optimal temperatures (18°C–21°C) away from direct sunlight. Parcels are transported in air-conditioned courier vehicles to guarantee that delicate top, heart, and base perfume notes remain pristine.
    </p>
    <p>
      Upon delivery, our courier will allow you to inspect the exterior factory cellophane wrapping, authenticity seal, and presentation box prior to completing payment.
    </p>
  </section>
</PolicyLayout>
